## Status

Full `nougat` / `marker` extraction was NOT executed in this backfill run.
Per the backfill task constraints:
- Do NOT re-run simulations.
- Free endpoints only.
- Incremental writes, no batched heavy compute.

Nougat/marker runs are the LUCID-100 program's OCR/parse layer and are owned by
Ollie (nougat) and KuklaBot (marker) per the 2026-06-23 lane split. Running
them from a subagent backfill would (a) duplicate work already scheduled in
the parser lane, (b) burn uicgpu A100 time out of policy, and (c) risk
collisions with the standing pipeline.

## What we already have as substitutes

